<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Sham Pal — Laravel and front-end developer</title>
<meta name="description" content="Ten years building web applications in PHP and Laravel. SaaS platforms, e-commerce, APIs, AI integrations and workflow automation. Available for freelance and contract work.">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,600;12..96,700&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  :root {
    --ink:      #16231e;
    --ink-soft: #4a5a53;
    --paper:    #e4e7de;
    --panel:    #f7f8f4;
    --rule:     #c2c9ba;
    --rule-faint:#d5dbcd;
    --green:    #2e5e4e;
    --ochre:    #8c5a00;

    --display: "Bricolage Grotesque", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    --text: "Source Serif 4", Georgia, serif;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  section { scroll-margin-top: 4.5rem; }

  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .page { max-width: 58rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }

  a { color: inherit; }
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--green);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  /* ---------- masthead ---------- */

  /* ---------- header ---------- */

  .masthead {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 10;
    background: rgba(228, 231, 222, 0.92);
    backdrop-filter: saturate(140%) blur(8px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .masthead .bar {
    max-width: 58rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: .9rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .wordmark {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .masthead nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: .92rem;
  }
  .masthead nav a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    padding: .2rem 0;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
  }
  .masthead nav a:hover { color: var(--ink); border-bottom-color: var(--green); }
  .masthead nav a.hire {
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--green);
    border: 1px solid var(--green);
    padding: .4rem .9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .masthead nav a.hire:hover { background: #0c5646; border-color: #0c5646; color: #fff; }

  /* ---------- hero: ruled register paper ---------- */

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 4.5rem 0 4rem;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 2rem 0 1rem;
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent 0,
      transparent 2.24rem,
      var(--rule-faint) 2.24rem,
      var(--rule-faint) 2.3rem
    );
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .hero > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  .hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 9vw, 5.2rem);
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    max-width: 16ch;
  }

  .standfirst {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.4vw, 1.3rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 44ch;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }

  .available {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .6rem;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: .95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: .5rem .95rem;
  }
  .dot {
    width: .55rem; height: .55rem;
    background: var(--green);
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex: none;
  }

  /* ---------- sections ---------- */

  section { padding: 3.5rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
  }

  /* ---------- the register of shipped work ---------- */

  .register { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }

  .entry {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: .25rem 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.6rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-faint);
  }

  .entry h3 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .entry p {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin: .4rem 0 0;
    max-width: 58ch;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .entry .built {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin: .7rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: .85rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .entry .built a {
    color: var(--green);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration-color: var(--green);
  }

  .state {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: .8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    align-self: center;
    padding: .2rem .6rem;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .state.live  { color: var(--green); }
  .state.early { color: var(--ochre); }
  .state.demo  { color: var(--ink-soft); }

  /* ---------- what I take on ---------- */

  .work { display: grid; gap: 0; }
  .work a { color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; text-decoration-color: var(--green); }

  .work div {
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-faint);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 13rem 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .work h3 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .work p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 52ch; }

  /* ---------- contact ---------- */

  .contact p { max-width: 46ch; }

  .lines { margin: 2rem 0 0; display: grid; gap: .9rem; }
  .lines a {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--rule);
    padding-bottom: .15rem;
    justify-self: start;
  }
  .lines a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--green); color: var(--green); }

  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 1.75rem 0 3rem;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: .85rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    body { font-size: 1rem; }
    .masthead .bar { padding: .75rem 1.25rem; gap: .9rem; }
    .masthead nav { gap: 1rem; font-size: .85rem; }
    .masthead nav a.hire { padding: .35rem .75rem; }
    .hero { padding: 3rem 0 2.5rem; }
    .hero::before { display: none; }
    .entry { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .state { justify-self: start; margin-top: .5rem; }
    .work div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .3rem; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="masthead">
  <div class="bar">
    <a class="wordmark" href="/">Sham Pal</a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#work">Work</a>
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a class="hire" href="#contact">Hire me</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="page">

  <div class="hero">
    <h1>I build the software that runs schools and shift work.</h1>
    <p class="standfirst">
      Ten years writing PHP and Laravel, with the front end to match, and more
      recently the AI and automation work that sits on top. Two of my products
      are in daily use by the people they were built for.
    </p>
    <p class="available"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Taking on freelance and contract work</p>
  </div>

  <section id="work">
    <h2>What I've shipped</h2>

    <div class="register">

      <article class="entry">
        <h3>MyShift</h3>
        <span class="state live">In daily use</span>
        <p>
          Employee attendance and time tracking. Staff clock in and out, managers
          see who is on shift and who isn't, and the month's hours come out the
          other end without anyone maintaining a spreadsheet. Built for workplaces
          where people work shifts rather than sit at a desk.
        </p>
        <p class="built">PHP · Laravel · MySQL · <a href="https://vexanto.in">vexanto.in</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="entry">
        <h3>VexEdu</h3>
        <span class="state early">First schools onboarding</span>
        <p>
          School management, built multi-tenant so every school gets its own space
          on one platform rather than a separate installation each. Attendance and
          fees for staff, a parent portal that works properly on a phone, online fee
          payment through Razorpay, and an admin layer above it all for running the
          platform across schools.
        </p>
        <p class="built">Laravel · MySQL · Razorpay · Android app · <a href="https://vexedu.in">vexedu.in</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="entry">
        <h3>Resume screener</h3>
        <span class="state demo">Live demo</span>
        <p>
          Upload a batch of CVs against a job description and get them back ranked,
          with the reasoning written out for each one. Built to show how an AI model
          fits into an ordinary Laravel application: queued background jobs so a
          fifty-file upload doesn't block anything, a JSON API for an ATS to poll,
          and output that's validated rather than trusted.
        </p>
        <p class="built">Laravel · queues · Claude API · <a href="https://screener.todarweb.com">try it yourself</a></p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="services">
    <h2>What I take on</h2>
    <div class="work">
      <div>
        <h3>Web applications and SaaS</h3>
        <p>Laravel and PHP backends, React and Node where they fit, and the front end on top. From first commit to live server.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>E-commerce</h3>
        <p>WordPress and WooCommerce, Shopify builds and app integrations, and the payment side that has to reconcile correctly.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>APIs and integrations</h3>
        <p>REST APIs for your own apps to use, and connecting the third-party services you already run — including the webhook handling that keeps records straight.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>AI features that hold up</h3>
        <p>OpenAI and Claude built into real applications: chatbots, document and CV processing, drafting tools. Queued properly, with output you can check.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Chrome extensions</h3>
        <p>Browser automation and third-party integrations for client projects, plus my own: <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/torry/amgdmokmcgdoodpfegebpahngimkafin">Torry</a>, an anonymous-search extension on the Chrome Web Store.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Workflow automation</h3>
        <p>n8n, Make and Zapier wired into your CRM, email and lead handling, so the repetitive work stops landing on someone's desk.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Fixing and maintaining</h3>
        <p>An application someone else left half finished, one that has slowed down, or one that has outgrown the hosting it was put on.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      Tell me what you're trying to build and roughly when you need it. I'll tell
      you straight whether I'm the right person for it.
    </p>
    <div class="lines">
      <a href="tel:+919872872276">+91 98728 72276</a>
      <a href="mailto:shamjaswal@gmail.com">shamjaswal@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sham-pal-913099212/" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <span>Sham Pal — Vexanto</span>
    <span>Available for freelance and contract work</span>
  </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
